d the information on these  people they he gave his name Josef  Mengele it meant nothing to an American  GI or to anybody at that time and so  that he was released and his family were  very wealthy manufacturers in Bavaria  and they were able to hide him on a in a  stable I mean as a stable hand on a farm  in Bavaria until he escaped to South  America okay  Charles
 

